EmailTemplate.textOnly:
{!advpm__Matter__c.Name_of_Borrower__c}, is in default on its loan agreement with National Funding and you are in default on the related guaranty.  To collect on this default we are prepared to file suit against you and/or the company. Attached is a draft copy of the complaint we will be filing with the court next week if we don’t hear from you regarding repayment.  Please contact us so we can work out a repayment arrangement otherwise we will move forward with litigation and you and/or the business will be subject to additional court costs and attorney’s fees.

I look forward to hearing from you.

Best Regards,

{!User.Name} | {!User.Title}
{!advpm__Matter__c.Email_Signature_Company__c}

